# 中频词汇 List02 单词

## confine
- **音标**: /kənˈfaɪn/
- **词性**: vt.
- **释义**: 限制；禁闭
- **例句**: The patients were confined to the hospital.
- **近义词**: restrict, limit
- **派生词**: confinement

## confirm
- **音标**: /kənˈfɜːrm/
- **词性**: vt.
- **释义**: 确认；证实
- **例句**: Please confirm your reservation.
- **近义词**: verify, validate
- **派生词**: confirmation

## conflict
- **音标**: /ˈkɑːnflɪkt/
- **词性**: n./v.
- **释义**: 冲突；矛盾
- **例句**: There is a conflict between the two groups.
- **近义词**: dispute, clash
- **派生词**: conflicting

## confront
- **音标**: /kənˈfrʌnt/
- **词性**: vt.
- **释义**: 面对；对抗
- **例句**: We must confront the problem directly.
- **近义词**: face, tackle
- **派生词**: confrontation

## consent
- **音标**: /kənˈsent/
- **词性**: n./v.
- **释义**: 同意；准许
- **例句**: You need parental consent.
- **近义词**: agreement, approval

## consequence
- **音标**: /ˈkɑːnsɪkwens/
- **词性**: n.
- **释义**: 后果；重要性
- **例句**: He suffered the consequences of his actions.
- **近义词**: result, outcome
- **派生词**: consequent

## conservative
- **音标**: /kənˈsɜːrvətɪv/
- **词性**: adj./n.
- **释义**: 保守的；保守派
- **例句**: He holds conservative views.
- **近义词**: traditional, moderate
- **派生词**: conservatively

## considerable
- **音标**: /kənˈsɪdərəbl/
- **词性**: adj.
- **释义**: 相当大的；重要的
- **例句**: A considerable amount of time was spent.
- **近义词**: significant, substantial
- **派生词**: considerably

## consistent
- **音标**: /kənˈsɪstənt/
- **词性**: adj.
- **释义**: 一致的；始终如一的
- **例句**: Her work has been consistent.
- **近义词**: steady, uniform
- **派生词**: consistently

## constitute
- **音标**: /ˈkɑːnstɪtuːt/
- **词性**: vt.
- **释义**: 构成；组成
- **例句**: Women constitute 60% of the workforce.
- **近义词**: compose, form
- **派生词**: constitution

## construct
- **音标**: /kənˈstrʌkt/
- **词性**: vt.
- **释义**: 建造；构建
- **例句**: They constructed a new bridge.
- **近义词**: build, erect
- **派生词**: construction

## consult
- **音标**: /kənˈsʌlt/
- **词性**: v.
- **释义**: 咨询；查阅
- **例句**: Please consult a doctor.
- **近义词**: advise, refer to
- **派生词**: consultation

## consume
- **音标**: /kənˈsuːm/
- **词性**: vt.
- **释义**: 消耗；消费
- **例句**: The car consumes a lot of fuel.
- **近义词**: use up, deplete
- **派生词**: consumer, consumption

## contemporary
- **音标**: /kənˈtempəreri/
- **词性**: adj./n.
- **释义**: 当代的；同时代的人
- **例句**: Contemporary art is often controversial.
- **近义词**: modern, current

## contend
- **音标**: /kənˈtend/
- **词性**: v.
- **释义**: 竞争；主张
- **例句**: Several teams contended for the title.
- **近义词**: compete, argue
- **派生词**: contender

## contradict
- **音标**: /ˌkɑːntrəˈdɪkt/
- **词性**: vt.
- **释义**: 反驳；与…矛盾
- **例句**: The evidence contradicts his statement.
- **近义词**: oppose, deny
- **派生词**: contradiction

## contribute
- **音标**: /kənˈtrɪbjuːt/
- **词性**: v.
- **释义**: 贡献；投稿
- **例句**: Everyone should contribute to the team.
- **近义词**: donate, give
- **派生词**: contribution

## controversy
- **音标**: /ˈkɑːntrəvɜːrsi/
- **词性**: n.
- **释义**: 争论；争议
- **例句**: The decision caused a lot of controversy.
- **近义词**: dispute, debate
- **派生词**: controversial

## convention
- **音标**: /kənˈvenʃn/
- **词性**: n.
- **释义**: 惯例；大会
- **例句**: It is a convention to shake hands.
- **近义词**: tradition, custom
- **派生词**: conventional

## convert
- **音标**: /kənˈvɜːrt/
- **词性**: v.
- **释义**: 转换；改变信仰
- **例句**: They converted the garage into a studio.
- **近义词**: change, transform
- **派生词**: conversion

## convince
- **音标**: /kənˈvɪns/
- **词性**: vt.
- **释义**: 说服；使确信
- **例句**: I convinced him to stay.
- **近义词**: persuade
- **派生词**: convincing

## cooperate
- **音标**: /koʊˈɑːpəreɪt/
- **词性**: vi.
- **释义**: 合作；配合
- **例句**: The two companies agreed to cooperate.
- **近义词**: collaborate
- **派生词**: cooperation

## coordinate
- **音标**: /koʊˈɔːrdɪneɪt/
- **词性**: v./n.
- **释义**: 协调；坐标
- **例句**: We need to coordinate our efforts.
- **近义词**: organize, arrange
- **派生词**: coordination

## cope
- **音标**: /koʊp/
- **词性**: vi.
- **释义**: 应对；处理
- **例句**: She learned to cope with stress.
- **近义词**: deal with, handle

## correspond
- **音标**: /ˌkɔːrəˈspɑːnd/
- **词性**: v.
- **释义**: 通信；相当于
- **例句**: The data corresponds to our findings.
- **近义词**: match, relate
- **派生词**: correspondence
